@page "/privacy"
@attribute [Microsoft.AspNetCore.OutputCaching.OutputCache(PolicyName = "StaticPages")]
@inject JASIntWeb.Services.Seo.ISeoService Seo

<SeoHead Title="Privacy & Cookie Policy | JAS International"
         Description="Read JAS International's Privacy Policy regarding order data, Meta Pixel, Conversions API, cookie usage, and customer data rights."
         CanonicalPath="/privacy"
         OgImage="/jas-og-card.png" />

<div class="shop-container py-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 block mb-2">DATA PROTECTION</span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2">Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Effective: 2026 · Committed to safeguarding customer confidentiality and privacy rights</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xs space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                When you create an account, purchase products, or track shipments with JAS International, we collect the necessary contact details to fulfill your orders: your Full Name, Mobile Phone Number, Delivery Address (District, City, Street address), and optional Email Address.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. How Your Information Is Used</h2>
            <p>
                Your personal details are used strictly for:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
                <li>Processing and delivering your orders via authorized courier services.</li>
                <li>Sending SMS notifications and calling to verify Cash on Delivery (COD) deliveries.</li>
                <li>Managing customer warranty verification, replacement claims, and repair records.</li>
                <li>Allowing account holders to manage saved delivery preferences.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Advertising, Meta Pixel &amp; Conversions API</h2>
            <p>
                To measure advertising effectiveness and display relevant products on Facebook and Instagram, our website utilizes the <strong>Meta Pixel</strong> and <strong>Meta Conversions API (CAPI)</strong>. When you consent to tracking cookies:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
                <li>First-party cookies (such as <code>_fbp</code> and <code>_fbc</code>) may be stored for up to 90 days to attribute ad clicks and measure conversions.</li>
                <li>When placing an order or registering, customer contact signals (phone number and email) are normalized and cryptographically hashed with one-way SHA-256 before transmission to Meta. Plaintext personal information is never shared with third-party ad networks.</li>
                <li>You may accept or decline tracking cookies via our on-site cookie banner anytime.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Data Security &amp; Sharing</h2>
            <p>
                We do not sell, rent, or lease customer data to third-party advertisers. Delivery addresses and phone numbers are securely transmitted only to contracted courier logistics providers for the sole purpose of parcel delivery. Password credentials are encrypted using industry-standard ASP.NET Core cryptographic hashing.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Your Rights &amp; Data Deletion Requests</h2>
            <p>
                You may review, update, or remove your profile information and saved addresses anytime directly from your <a href="/account" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold underline">Customer Account Portal</a>.
            </p>
            <!--email_off-->
            <p class="mt-2">
                Under relevant data protection guidelines and Meta Platform rules, you have the right to request the permanent deletion of your customer account and associated transaction tracking records. To submit a data deletion request, email our compliance team at <a href="mailto:info@jasinternational.com.bd" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold underline">info@jasinternational.com.bd</a> with your registered mobile phone number. Deletion requests are processed within 7 business days.
            </p>
            <!--/email_off-->
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">6. Contact &amp; Grievance Redressal</h2>
            <!--email_off-->
            <p>
                If you have questions regarding our privacy practices or wish to submit a data inquiry, please contact our support desk directly at <a href="mailto:info@jasinternational.com.bd" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold underline">info@jasinternational.com.bd</a> or phone <a href="tel:01711465078" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold underline">01711465078</a>.
            </p>
            <!--/email_off-->
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
